Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that. That's what creates the barrier around the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's incredible! So, all the paths around here look exactly the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, no outsiders can get into Fugue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you do something to protect the sacred treasure too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we do. We all take turns guarding it.
